function text-mv-help() {
    cat <<'EOF'
Usage: envfolio text mv [-f|--force] <old-name> <new-name>

Rename or move a text, or every text in a folder (secrets in it stay where they are). At a
terminal, asks before overwriting unless --force; from a script or pipe, it overwrites.

Options:
  -f, --force         Overwrite without asking.
  -h, --help          Show this help and stop.
